   "notes": "The 300 K Vinet parameters and thermal parameters are one coupled published thermal EOS. V0, K0, K0', gamma0, and q were fitted; Tr=300 K, theta0=1000 K, and the 20-atom conventional-cell count were fixed. The complete five-parameter covariance is reconstructed from Tables 3-4 rather than treating strongly correlated errors as independent. Table 5 provides an independent source-output check: at 108.7 GPa and 2387 K the implementation reproduces density 5.40 g/cm3, KS=604.5 GPa, gamma=1.23, and Cv/(3Nk)=0.9838 at the source's printed precision."
